WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:04.964
This video shows how a parent views a child's information on a phone.

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:18.552
After you sign in, the dashboard shows a card for each of your children, with attendance, fees and the last exam at a glance. The menu button at the top left opens the other pages.

00:00:22.158 --> 00:00:26.958
Tap Overview on a child's card to open the full page for that child.

00:00:33.015 --> 00:00:42.519
At the top are the name, class and roll number. The cards below show the attendance rate, the fees, the last exam and the days present.

00:00:49.761 --> 00:01:00.489
Under Details, tap a page. Here we open Exam Results, which lists each exam with its total, percentage, grade and the marks for every subject.

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:20.373
Attendance, fees, timetable and results are all one tap away.
